THOUGHT: To fix the new NullAway error, I should avoid directly dereferencing Game.screens() (which is considered @Nullable). I can store it in a local variable, check it for null, and only then call current() and use the resulting Screen. This is a minimal change and won’t affect behavior. After editing, I’ll rerun the build to confirm the total NullAway error count drops from 151 to 150.

```bash
cd /home/vscode/nullness-benchmarks/litiengine && sed -i '132,158c\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ final var screens = Game.screens();
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ final Screen currentScreen = screens != null ? screens.current() : null;
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ if (currentScreen != null) {
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ long renderStart = System.nanoTime();
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ currentScreen.render(g);
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ if (Game.config().debug().trackRenderTimes()) {
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ final double totalRenderTime =
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ TimeUtilities.nanoToMs(System.nanoTime() - renderStart);
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ Game.metrics().trackRenderTime("screen", totalRenderTime);
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ }
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ }
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ Game.window().cursor().render(g);
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ for (final Consumer<Graphics2D> consumer : this.renderedConsumer) {
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ consumer.accept(g);
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ }
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ if (this.currentAlpha != Float.NaN) {
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ final int visibleAlpha =
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ MathUtilities.clamp(Math.round(255 * (1 - this.currentAlpha)), 0, 255);
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ g.setColor(
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ new Color(this.getBackground().getRGB() & 0xffffff | visibleAlpha << 24, true));
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ g.fill(bounds);
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ }
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ if (this.takeScreenShot && currentScreen != null) {
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ final BufferedImage img =
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ new BufferedImage(this.getWidth(), this.getHeight(), BufferedImage.TYPE_INT_RGB);
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ final Graphics2D imgGraphics = img.createGraphics();
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ currentScreen.render(imgGraphics);
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ imgGraphics.dispose();
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ this.saveScreenShot(img);
\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ }' src/de/gurkenlabs/litiengine/graphics/RenderComponent.java && ./gradlew compileJava -x test -q > new_build_output.log 2>&1 && grep -n "RenderComponent" new_build_output.log || grep -n "errors" new_build_output.log | tail -5
```

